2. From the page(s) labeled 'independent', extract independent_test findings (ids EXP-001, EXP-002, ...). If that page is actually about a closely related sibling/variant model rather than the exact product, say so explicitly in the source_name field.
3. From the page(s) labeled 'owner', extract owner_sentiment items (ids SENT-001, SENT-002, ...), each with topic/sentiment/detail.
4. From the page(s) labeled 'alternatives', extract 2-3 real alternative product names actually mentioned in that text, each with a one-sentence reason and using the given source_url.
